<title>INDIA: India forex, money markets shut Wednesday, Friday.</title>
<headline>India forex, money markets shut Wednesday, Friday.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's foreign exchange market are open only on Tuesday and Thursday this week due to a series of holidays.</p>
<p>Banks in Bombay, the country's commercial capital, and most other centres are closed on Wednesday for a Hindu festival and on Friday for a Moslem festival.</p>
<p>The money market will be open on Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday.</p>
<p>Banks were closed across the country on Monday for a national holiday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
